        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spot the Difference × ADV (Adventure Game)</h2><br><i><strong>You are Baku.<br><br>Today, once again,<br>an animal has come to you<br>complaining of insomnia.<br><br>Eat their nightmares<br>and save these troubled animals.<br><br>However, there is a secret to this story.</strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>'BAKU' is a<br>single-player mistake-finding game.<br>Compare the illustrations on the left and right to find the mistakes.<br>The ending will branch depending on the results of the mistake-finding. <br><br><strong>Playing time</strong><br>1–2 hours<br><br>*Our circle creates games with playing times that are easy to play in live videos and streams.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Notes】</h2>Streaming gameplay videos is welcome for both individuals and companies.<br>However, please ensure you review the following guidelines.<br><br>• Please include the store page URL in the description or other areas accessible to viewers.<br>• Monetization through video platform features (ad revenue, donations, etc.) is permitted.<br>• Streaming or broadcasting gameplay that includes defamatory content or violates public order and morality is prohibited.<br>• “Hirometen” shall not be held liable for any damages or issues arising from game commentary or streaming.  <br>• Use the hashtag “#BAKU” on Twitter (X). Fan art and derivative works are also welcome.  <br>• This agreement may be modified without notice, and any videos created after such modifications will be subject to the revised terms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Production】</h2>Hirometen<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Credits】</h2>Director: Hiroyu (@hiroyuuuu)<br>Illustration: Tenmiyakiyo (@tenmiyakiyo)<br>Editing: Memeko (@memekosanma)<br>Music: Suzuki Puyo (@SuzukiPuyo)<br>Programming: Suibotuman (@ik_suibotuman)",
